        "description": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Description",
            "content": "<p>Vanilla Canyon is inspired by the feeling of limitlessness. Like gazing into a vast canyon or driving toward the horizon on an open road, it’s an ode to awe-striking moments that take your breath away and make you feel alive. Vanilla Canyon is a soulful, yet sweet, take on vanilla. Warm vanilla is grounded in oak wood for a textured depth, and laced with wild honey, velvet plum, patchouli, and tonka, it lingers on the skin like a warm sunrise.</p>"
          }
        },
        "notes": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Notes",
            "content": "<p>Top: Velvet Plum, Tonka Beans<br>Heart: Jasmine Petals, Wild Honey<br>Base: Madagascar Vanilla, Patchouli, Oak Wood</p>"
          }
        },
        "ingredients": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ingredients",
            "content": "<p>Please be aware that ingredient lists may change or vary from time to time. Please refer to the ingredient list on the product package you receive for the most up to date list of ingredients.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ingredients: Alcohol Denat., Fragrance (Parfum), Vanillin, Water/Aqua/Eau, Tetramethyl Acetyloctahydronaphthalenes, Ethylhexyl Salicylate, Coumarin, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Pogostemon Cablin Oil, Rose Ketones, Beta-Caryophyllene.</p>"
          }
        },
